0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">공공데이터 활용</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">① </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">아이디어 기획</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">, ② </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">앱 개발</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 등 2개 부문</span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 4pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;* (아이디어 기획) 旣 개방된 데이터 외에 개방이 필요한 데이터까지 포함</font></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 2pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;* </span></span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(앱 개발) 정부, 지자체 등 공공기관의 공개 공공데이터(Open API 등)</span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 를 활용한 앱</font></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">□ </span></strong></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">참가 자격</span></font></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(아이디어 기획)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 공공데이터 분야 창의적 아이디어를 보유한 누구나</span></font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(앱 개발)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 공공데이터를 활용한 앱 개발 창업(희망)자</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(개인 또는 팀)</span></font></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -30pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 4pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 他 경진대회에 입상한 아이디어 또는 앱은 신청 불가</span></font></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -30pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 2pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">‘앱 개발’ 분야의 경우 접수 마감일까지 개발을 완료, 앱 마켓에 등록하여야 함</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;서류 및 발표평가 등 2단계 평가를 통해 부문별 수상작을 선정</font></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 4pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;* </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">평가 단계별</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">로 관련 분야 전문가 중심으로 구성된 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">평가위원회를 구성·운영</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -30.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 8pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -30pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;① </span></span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(서류평가)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 아이템 중복 여부 및 창의성, 충실성 등을 심사하여 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">부문별 각 20개 팀 선정</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 4pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -97.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 97.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 평가기준 : (아이디어 기획) 창의성, 구체성, 공공데이터 활용 적정성 등</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">(앱 개발) 아이템 우수성, 독창성, 활용 적정성, 개선？확장계획 적정성</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -30.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 8pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; TEXT-INDENT: -31.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.3pt\" cla